  negative_control: "Run new history/mutation-event-integrity.spec.ts against unchanged main3ba042b3d in an isolated worktree: stale same-length non-tail record_hash data is served and verification/raw timestamp controls fail. Identical post-fix controls pass. Review controls against ddc2d5ce1 fail three cases: call-order-dependent unverified timestamps and repeated reparsing of invalid-UTF8 receipts with and without SQLite; all pass after the exact-byte/projection refinements. Final review control against783318c3b warms two streams, appends to the first and corrupts the second, then proves a failed strict read must not hide the append on a selected unverified read; unchanged code fails and local staged-map publication passes."
